<p>I like this! One quick nitpick, though.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-5056-A emits a constant tone of 119 decibels</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Decibels is a loudness thing, not a pitch thing, so it should either say &quot;at 119 decibels,&quot; or &quot;of 119 hertz&quot; if you do mean pitch.<br />
Also, if you do in fact mean decibels, you should know that 119 decibels is extremely loud and <a href="http://https://www.healthlinkbc.ca/health-topics/tf4173">potentially damaging to the ears</a>, not just an &quot;inconvenience&quot; like Falkirk says in the footnotes of the test log.</p>

